{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681090/extras/Banner1.gif?t=1746054671\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Demo Version of \u201cShoestrings Story,\u201d<br>a point-and-click visual novel</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this demo, you can enjoy the opening chapters of the story while experiencing many of the game\u2019s key features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Retro dot-art graphics</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dialogue scenes</strong> with a cast of quirky, unforgettable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A variety of mini-games</strong> seamlessly woven into the visual-novel segments</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681090/extras/Banner2.gif?t=1746054671\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The protagonist is a freelance writer named Lovecatch. Due to childhood trauma, they are unable to speak and have no combat experience. However, after saving a wounded, mysterious creature known as a Mamono, they are unexpectedly chosen to become a &quot;Hero.&quot; Lovecatch\u2019s mission is to &quot;persuade&quot; an entity called the &quot;Demon King,&quot; who is said to command the Mamono, and bring an end to the 900-year-long war against these creatures.<br><br>You can experience the opening section of the story in this demo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681090/extras/Banner3.gif?t=1746054671\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3681090?t=1746054671","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/ap